<title>USA: USDA in $5 mln PL480 rice pact with Ivory Coast.</title>
<headline>USDA in $5 mln PL480 rice pact with Ivory Coast.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-07-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>The U.S. Agriculture Department Monday said it signed a Public Law 480 sales agreement with the Ivory Coast for $5 million worth of rice or about 13,000 tonnes.</p>
<p>The supply period is fiscal 1997.</p>
</text>
